(pricing. Harbor House and Larkspur Hotels have used the beta since) '
(July and both agreed to be quoted.) '
() '
(Message. One invoice per stay, whatever the stay was made of. Room) '
(nights, minibar, late checkout: all on the same line items, all in the) '
(same renewal.) '
() '
